n begin="00:21.090" end="00:21.210">don't </span><span begin="00:21.210" end="00:21.960">believe </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:22.020">in </span><span begin="00:22.020" end="00:23.070">soulmates</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.280" end="00:26.970"><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:24.060">But </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.150">I </span><span begin="00:24.150" end="00:24.690">won't </span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:24.990">let </span><span begin="00:24.990" end="00:25.080">that </span><span begin="00:25.080" end="00:25.620">get </span><span begin="00:25.620" end="00:25.830">in </span><span begin="00:25.830" end="00:25.920">the </span><span begin="00:25.920" end="00:26.970">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.660" end="00:30.540"><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:27.960">I </span><span begin="00:27.960" end="00:28.110">don't </span><span begin="00:28.110" end="00:28.410">mean </span><span begin="00:28.410" end="00:28.470">to </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:29.940">complicate </span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:30.540">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.870" end="00:34.050"><span begin="00:30.870" end="00:31.080">But </span><span begin="00:31.080" end="00:31.410">there's </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:31.620">no </span><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:31.890">other </span><span begin="00:31.890" end="00:32.850">way </span><span begin="00:32.850" end="00:33.420">around </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:34.050">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.290" end="00:36.750"><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.500">To </span><span begin="00:34.500" end="00:34.800">try </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:34.950">to </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:35.430">make </span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:35.850">one </span><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.120">out </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.210">of </span><span begin="00:36.210" end="00:36.750">two</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.780" end="00:40.770"><span begin="00:36.780" end="00:37.950">When </span><span begin="00:37.950" end="00:38.190">I </span><span begin="00:38.190" end="00:38.310">am </span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.880">me </span><span begin="00:38.880" end="00:39.210">and </span><span begin="00:39.210" end="00:39.540">you </span><span begin="00:39.540" end="00:39.630">are </span><span begin="00:39.630" end="00:40.770">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.370" end="00:47.250"><span begin="00:41.370" end="00:41.940">What </span><span begin="00:41.940" end="00:42.300">am </span><span begin="00:42.300" end="00:42.540">I </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:43.980">supposed </span><span begin="00:43.980" end="00:44.280">to </span><span begin="00:44.280" end="00:46.410">do</span><span begin="00:46.410" end="00:47.250">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.250" end="00:49.590"><span begin="00:47.250" end="00:47.910">When </span><span begin="00:47.910" end="00:48.150">I </span><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.810">fall </span><span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.020">for </span><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.590">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.770" end="00:53.220"><span begin="00:49.770" end="00:49.890">I'll </span><span begin="00:49.890" end="00:50.430">change </span><span begin="00:50.430" end="00:50.760">my </span><span begin="00:50.760" end="00:51.300">colors </span><span begin="00:51.300" end="00:51.540">if </span><span begin="00:51.540" end="00:51.690">I </span><span begin="00:51.690" end="00:52.470">have </span><span begin="00:52.470" end="00:53.220">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.220" end="00:57.270"><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.430">If </span><span begin="00:53.430" end="00:54.120">anyone </span><span begin="00:54.120" end="00:54.270">is </span><span begin="00:54.270" end="00:54.660">worth </span><span begin="00:54.660" end="00:54.750">it</span><span begin="00:54.750" end="00:54.750">, </span><span begin="00:54.750" end="00:55.050">I </span><span begin="00:55.050" end="00:55.650">think </span><span begin="00:55.650" end="00:56.190">it's </span><span begin="00:56.190" end="00:57.270">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.570" end="01:01.050"><span begin="00:57.570" end="00:58.200">Baby</span><span begin="00:58.200" end="00:58.200">, </span><span begin="00:58.200" end="00:58.530">I'd </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.920">die </span><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.580">for </span><span begin="00:59.580" end="01:01.050">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.080" end="01:03.270"><span begin="01:01.080" end="01:01.590">When </span><span begin="01:01.590" end="01:01.830">I </span><span begin="01:01.830" end="01:02.550">fall </span><span begin="01:02.550" end="01:02.760">for </span><span begin="01:02.760" end="01:03.270">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.510" end="01:06.900"><span begin="01:03.510" end="01:03.600">We'll </span><span begin="01:03.600" end="01:04.140">dance </span><span begin="01:04.140" end="01:04.380">like </span><span begin="01:04.380" end="01:04.530">the </span><span begin="01:04.530" end="01:04.980">leaves </span><span begin="01:04.980" end="01:05.220">when </span><span begin="01:05.220" end="01:05.370">their </span><span begin="01:05.370" end="01:06.060">time </span><span begin="01:06.060" end="01:06.270">is </span><span begin="01:06.270" end="01:06.900">due</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.900" end="01:10.890"><span begin="01:06.900" end="01:07.590">Forgive </span><span begin="01:07.590" end="01:07.800">and </span><span begin="01:07.800" end="01:08.220">forget </span><span begin="01:08.220" end="01:08.370">to </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.880">make </span><span begin="01:08.880" end="01:09.210">room </span><span begin="01:09.210" end="01:09.780">for </span><span begin="01:09.780" end="01:10.890">new</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.280" end="01:14.910"><span begin="01:11.280" end="01:11.880">Baby</